<img src="https://images.macrumors.com/article-new/2023/11/apple-pay-feature-dynamic-island.jpg" alt="" width="160" height="90" class="alignleft size-full wp-image-1058944" />Apple Pay will launch in India by this October, reports <em><a href="https://www.business-standard.com/finance/news/dropping-this-oct-apple-pay-services-set-for-india-launch-no-upi-yet-126080900805_1.html">Business Standard</a></em>, citing people familiar with the matter. Apple Pay will support major credit card networks like Visa and Mastercard, but it won't support transactions via the country's Unified Payments Interface (UPI) at launch. <br/>
<br/>
